date-released: 2026-09-12
abstract: "Output-aware recurrent-state quantization through fixed precision masks and bounded integer-code correction. Includes a separately identified same-byte codec revision, reference and optimized GDN storage paths, frozen all-layer allocation policies, and CPU-recomputable observations. Earlier GDN, FA_CODE and independent GDN2 operator evidence remains distinct. Quality, storage, numerical boundaries and runtime are reported separately; pretrained GDN2 language quality and production readiness are not claimed."
